# Design Tokens

Values live in Foundations (`packages/ui/src/foundations/`). This rule states usage only. Rationale: `docs/DESIGN.md`.

`pnpm check:tokens` must pass before any work is considered complete.

## Dimensions

- Spacing tokens are for rhythm only (padding, gaps, margins) — never for sizing components.
- Component dimensions are component tokens defined alongside the component.
- Never inline raw dimensions (px, rem literals, arbitrary Tailwind sizes).

## Icons

- Size always from `--icon-*`. Never `size-4`, `size-[14px]`, or hardcoded px.
- Glyphs: Lucide for system UI, Solar Bold Duotone for illustrative accents. Never mix sets in one interface.

## Colors

- Semantic color classes only. Never hex literals.

## Motion

- No duration/easing tokens exist yet. Do not invent them.
- On second use of the same motion value, promote it to Foundations.
